  "description_text": "Welcome to this brand-new and fully detached home in Highland Park, with 2 bedrooms, a huge fenced yard and 2 parking spaces. The bright main floor has a living room up front with its own door to the large patio, and built-in Bluetooth speakers throughout. The kitchen offers stainless appliances, under-cabinet lighting, an attached dining area and a second door out to the patio and lawn. Up the lit staircase are both bedrooms and a tiled 3/4 bath with heated floors. Ductless mini-splits cover heating and cooling. Blocks from Westcrest Park, with White Center shops and restaurants just south.",
