  "description_text": "Broadview awesome, fresh, good as new (just remodeled) bungalow in Bitter Lake! A cheerful, bright 2-bedroom, 2- bath cottage, boasting a gorgeous new remodel, and privacy fence around your beautiful yard! Located in a pristine boutique setting entirely move-in ready. Offering 1006 square feet of stylish living space across two levels with big sliding doors to the spacious fenced yard. The home features soaring vaulted ceilings and a private layout with one bedroom up and one down. Great for Roomies! Thoughtful modern upgrades include a tankless water heater, sound-deadening insulation to minimize exterior road noise, in-unit laundry, and tandem parking spaces for two or more vehicles. Tucked away for an extra layer of privacy, the property features a fully fenced layout that ensures a quiet, secure oasis while keeping you just minutes from local parks, coffee shops, dining, and the RapidRide E Line for a seamless commute to downtown Seattle and major tech hubs. No Dues- HOA is for water and sewer only.",
